    "plain_text": "Organic content is a long-term game, and it requires high volume so you can build an engagement farming machine.\nHere’s an example: an AI calorie tracker app making over $20k/month just from AI influencers on TikTok. (And all revenue tracking tools tend to underestimate actual revenue by about 50%-100%, which means these two app platforms could actually be generating over $40k–$50k per month.)\nYes, you heard that right, another AI calorie tracker app lol.\n \n \n \n \n \nThey’ve created over 30–40 influencers (that’s just what I’ve been able to research, I think there are even more), and all of them are automated to promote their products (similar to how I do it with my own products).\nAnd This is:\nHow to Build a Scalable AI Influencer Machine.\nNanoBanana + Arcads.\nThat’s literally my entire stack.\nI don’t need an agency.\nI don’t need a content team.\nI can create dozens of AI influencer videos at scale, consistently, and organically.\nThe biggest thing most people get wrong\nThe internet already tells you what works.\nEvery viral TikTok, Reel, or Short is:\nproof of demand\nproof of structure\nproof of messaging\nYour job is not to be creative from scratch.\nYour job is to distribute intelligently.\nStep 1: Don’t guess. Learn from what already works\nI scroll:\nTikTok\nInstagram Reels\nYouTube Shorts\nI look for:\nhooks in first 2–3 seconds\nstrong retention\nreal comments\nFree market research at scale.\nStep 2: Generate unique AI influencers\nMost people reuse one face.\nI don’t.\nEach influencer has:\nunique face\nunique vibe\nspecific persona\nUsing NanoBanana:\ngenerate fast\ncontrol style\navoid repetition\nUnique faces = scalability.\nStep 3: Realism beats perfection\nIf it looks fake, it’s your prompt.\nAvoid:\nperfect lighting\nmodel aesthetic\nFocus on:\nimperfect shots\ncasual moments\nreal-life environments\nStep 4: Prompt like an engineer (this is the cheat code)\nInside Arcads with Grok Imagine, structure > creativity.\nUse JSON to control everything.\nFramework:\nLock identity\nAdd real environment\nSimulate smartphone camera\nJSON Example (copy this format)\n \n \nI find this prompt from: \n \nWhy this JSON works\nremoves ambiguity\nforces realism\ncreates repeatable system\neasy to scale across multiple influencers\nYou’re not prompting anymore.\nYou’re building a system.\nStep 5: Turn images into videos\nImages don’t convert.\nVideos do.\nWith Arcads:\nanimate naturally\nmatch TikTok behavior\nfeel like UGC\nGoal: looks like real creator.\nStep 6: Use Pinterest for slideshow content\nPinterest is infinite content.\nSearch:\nglow up\nstudy\nfitness\nself improvement\nPick:\nrelatable\nemotional\nslightly imperfect\nSlideshow structure\nSlide 1: Hook\nSlide 2–5: Story\nSlide 6: Result\nSlide 7: CTA\nCombine everything\nBest setup:\nAI influencer for authority\nPinterest images for story\nvideo for conversion\nThis gives:\nhigh retention\nfast production\nmassive scale\nStep 7: Remix, don’t copy\nYou remix:\nhook\nangle\nstructure\nSame psychology.\nDifferent execution.\nFinal thought\nIf you want AI influencers that convert:\nStop prompting like an artist.\nStart building systems.\nThat’s the difference between:\npeople who post content\nand people who build content machines 💪",
    "preview_text": "Organic content is a long-term game, and it requires high volume so you can build an engagement farming machine.\nHere’s an example: an AI calorie tracker app making over $20k/month just from AI",
    "rest_id": "2050683101765128192",
    "summary_text": "- Organic content demands high volume to build an engagement farming machine on TikTok.\n- One AI calorie tracker app generates over $20k–$50k/month using 30–40 automated AI influencers.\n- Stack uses NanoBanana to generate unique faces, vibes, and personas for each influencer.\n- Realism beats perfection: focus on imperfect shots, casual moments, and real-life environments via structured JSON prompts in Arcads with Grok Imagine.\n- Turn images into natural UGC-style videos, remix proven hooks and structures from viral content, and combine AI authority with Pinterest slideshow stories for scalable conversion.",
    "title": "How to create multiple AI influencers to market on TikTok (Step-by-step simple guide) "
  }
